      "height": 60,
      "text": "运行时中间审查 (run_mid_flow_review):\n    FlowPipeline 还暴露了独立函数，可在 Agent 循环中直接注入审查\n    检测到 write_file / execute_command 等变异操作时 → 触发中间审查",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
