      "text": "findings 结构化输出格式:\n\n<findings>\n[CRITICAL] path/file:42 - desc\n  suggestion: how to fix\n[HIGH] path/file:88 - desc\n  suggestion: how to fix\n</findings>\n\n或\n\n<findings>PASS</findings>",
